# Toggly CLI

**Ship features with confidence.** The official command-line interface for [Toggly](https://toggly.io) — feature flags, environments, and releases for humans and CI.

Installs the `toggly` binary on your PATH (package id stays `toggly-cli`).

![Toggly](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ops-ai/toggly-cli-dist/main/assets/package-icon.png)

## Why Toggly CLI?

- **Device-code login** for developers (tokens stay in the OS credential store)
- **Client-credentials** for pipelines (`TOGGLY_CLIENT_ID` / `TOGGLY_CLIENT_SECRET`)
- **Noun-first commands** — `toggly app`, `env`, `feature`, `release`, `context`
- **`--json` output** for scripts and automation
- **Same binaries** as GitHub Releases (`cli-v*`) — no rebuild-per-channel

## Quick start

```powershell
choco install toggly-cli
toggly auth login
toggly app list
toggly --json feature list --app <app-id>
```

